المزخرف يغلّف الدالة دون تعديلها:
import time
def timed(fn):
    def inner(*args, **kw):
        t0 = time.time()
        out = fn(*args, **kw)
        print(f"{fn.__name__}: {time.time() - t0:.2f}s")
        return out
    return inner
@timed
def work():
    return sum(range(1000000))

en.answer:
A decorator wraps a function without changing it:
import time
def timed(fn):
    def inner(*args, **kw):
        t0 = time.time()
        out = fn(*args, **kw)
        print(f"{fn.__name__}: {time.time() - t0:.2f}s")
        return out
    return inner
@timed
def work():
    return sum(range(1000000))

